# User roles (#135). Admin only: authenticate with an access token of a user having the Admin role.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-admin-access-token-here
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List application roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users with roles (q = e-mail substring)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?q=example&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles of a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set roles of a user (replaces the whole set; Sales = Obchod, Designer = Projektant, Technician = Technik)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["Sales", "Designer"]
}
